			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Neatly tacked up on the message board inside the Kindred Spirits, a freshly inked parchment is displayed:
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Concordat Angelis, allies, and friends:
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
We gather this Sunday inside the Oasis of Marr in Antonica to do battle with the spectres that haunt the spectre island. Too often has the life of an unwary traveler been taken at their icy grip, set loose by those who thought they could defeat them. We draw an end to their existence Sunday. Mustering will be held at the docks in Oasis, and transports will be available for those who need them. Those too young to face the spectres are free to do battle with the other undead, orcs, and creatures inside the Oasis, with the magical assistance of the older Concordat present. 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
In the event we cannot acquire the Spectre camp, and if those attending find it acceptable, we shall head to the Tower of Frozen Shadow to see how high we can climb before it's denizens prove too strong. 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Lanturias
<br />

<br />
Beguiler and Councilor
<br />

<br />
Concordat Angelis 
<br />
